# Captain dev workflow (mandatory)

Read **`docs/agents/captain-dev-workflow.md`**, **`docs/agents/agent-tooling-index.md`**, and
**`docs/share/proplane-collaborator-workflow.md`** (for sharing with friends).

**① Ticket → ② Plan + share → ③ Execute → ④ Review → ⑤ Promote**

Visual board: `npm run lavish:workflow`

## ① Ticket + ② Plan (default)

If the captain describes work, a bug, an idea, or pastes feedback — run **workflow
plan** before anything else, even if they did not ask.

```bash
npm run workflow:plan -- --chat "<their message>"
```

Ticket only (no plan yet): `npm run linear:ticket -- --chat "…"`

Skip only when they explicitly say **"no ticket"** or **"skip plan"** (hotfix).

Reply with **PRP-###** + full Linear URL + plan path. **Stop until approved — build.**

See **`lavish-plan-gate.mdc`**.

### Share with a friend (phase ②)

```bash
npm run linear:export -- --ticket PRP-### --out .lavish/plans/PRP-###-slug/ticket.md
```

Optional public Lavish URL: `npx -y lavish-axi share <plan.html>`

Poll: `npx -y lavish-axi poll .lavish/plans/PRP-###-…/plan.html`

UI work: follow `docs/agents/ui-change-checklist.md`

## ③ Execute

- Keeper branch + sandbox port: see **`local-agent-branch.mdc`** (this pane).
- Read `docs/portal-ui-system.md` before portal UI; `docs/agents/<area>.md` before features.
- MCP: `.cursor/mcp.json` — see agent-tooling-index.
- Reference **PRP-###** in commits.

## ④ Review

Test on **this pane's sandbox URL**. Update Linear. Do not merge to `prakrit` yourself.

## ⑤ Promote (captain only)

```bash
bin/fm-proplane-promote-to-prakrit.sh <keeper-branch>
```

## Production data (never)

Dev/test Supabase only. See `no-production-data-writes.mdc`.
